{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discord-style session-resume client. Runs as an actor so callers don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have to worry about thread-safety; you can poke it from your transport"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"task and from the main actor freely."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SessionCoordinator","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Architecture","level":1,"anchor":"Architecture"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The coordinator owns three pieces of state:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The in-memory "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (handshaking \/ replaying \/ live \/ disconnected).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A persistent "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(sessionId, lastSeq)"},{"type":"text","text":" cursor in "},{"code":"SessionStorage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A heartbeat timer that fires while the connection is healthy."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" own the connection itself — that’s your transport’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"problem. The coordinator just decides what to send when you tell it","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“the connection is open” or “I received this frame”."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Lifecycle (the seven calls you’ll make)","level":1,"anchor":"Lifecycle-the-seven-calls-youll-make"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeLi